---
// One-page printable guide for the owner. Contains no password.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>T&amp;M Owner Home — Quick Guide</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <style is:inline>
      @page { margin: 0.6in; }
      body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #0f2438; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; }
      h1 { font-size: 34px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
      .sub { color: #4a5d73; margin: 0 0 18px; }
      .box { border: 3px solid #0f2438; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 14px 0; }
      .box b.big { font-size: 26px; display: block; }
      ol { margin: 8px 0 0 22px; padding: 0; }
      li { margin: 8px 0; }
      .pw { display: inline-block; min-width: 320px; border-bottom: 3px solid #0f2438; height: 34px; vertical-align: bottom; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; background: #0f2438; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 22px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; margin: 8px 0 16px; }
      @media print { .btn { display: none; } body { padding: 0; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <button class="btn" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ Print this page</button>
    <h1>T&amp;M Owner Home</h1>
    <p class="sub">Your simple screen for customers, signatures and printed forms.</p>

    <div class="box">
      <b class="big">1. Open it</b>
      On your phone or tablet, open the internet and go to:<br />
      <b>tandmbak.com/owner.html</b>
      <ol>
        <li>Type your password:  <span class="pw"></span></li>
        <li>Press the green <b>OPEN</b> button.</li>
      </ol>
      <p style="margin:10px 0 0">Tip: tap Share, then "Add to Home Screen". Then you just tap the T&amp;M picture.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <b class="big">2. A customer wants to sign</b>
      <ol>
        <li>Press the big red button: <b>New customer signs here</b>.</li>
        <li>Page 1: type their name and phone. Press NEXT.</li>
        <li>Page 2: type the address, the job, and the price. Press NEXT.</li>
        <li>Hand them the phone. They read, tap the check box, and sign with a finger.</li>
        <li>Press <b>I AGREE — SAVE</b>. Then press <b>PRINT OR SAVE A COPY</b>.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <b class="big">3. Print a blank form</b>
      Press <b>Print a blank form</b>, then <b>PRINT</b>. Choose your printer (or "Save as PDF").
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <b class="big">4. See your customers</b>
      Press <b>My customers</b>. Press <b>Call</b> or <b>Text</b> on any name.<br />
      <b>Booked jobs</b> shows people who paid the $30 deposit.
    </div>

    <p class="sub">If something looks stuck: close the page, open it again, and type your password.</p>
  </body>
</html>
